B.ak8=s(["Industry and geography","Owner involvement","Must-haves and deal breakers"],t.s)
B.acb=new A.d5("Define your ideal business","Choose the industries, locations and size of business you want to explore. Think about the work you want to do each week, the skills you bring and the responsibilities you want to take on.",B.ak8)
B.amm=s(["Available personal capital","Target purchase range","Financing questions"],t.s)
B.ac7=new A.d5("Set a realistic search range","Record the capital you can contribute and the purchase range you want to investigate. Separate what is available today from financing that still needs a lender\u2019s approval.",B.amm)
B.aoH=s(["Screen an opportunity","Discuss your criteria","Refine as you learn"],t.s)
B.abU=new A.d5("Use the brief to compare opportunities","Bring your criteria into the Deal screen, shortlist businesses that fit, and refine your Blueprint as you learn. A saved brief gives future conversations with advisers a useful starting point.",B.aoH)
B.ajK=s([B.acb,B.ac7,B.abU],t.IL)
B.aOD=new A.T("Do I need a business in mind?","No. Your Blueprint is useful before you start searching and can be updated when you find a specific opportunity.")
